<title>UK: Deutsche sets call warrants on DAX and MDAX.</title>
<headline>Deutsche sets call warrants on DAX and MDAX.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued European-style capped call warrants of 10 million per tranche on the DAX index and the Mid-Cap-Index (MDAX), lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   30.DEC.97		 PAYDATE	28.FEB.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFT/DUES		  MIN EXER LOT 100 * * * *</p>
<p> WARRANT	STRIKE	ISSUE     CAP</p>
<p>DAX INDEX - (SPOT REF 3,175.07 DEM)</p>
<p> CALL A	 3,000 DEM   1.41 DEM  3,200 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B	 3,100 DEM   1.26 DEM  3,300 DEM MDAX INDEX - (SPOT</p>
<p>REF 3,286.41 DEM)</p>
<p> CALL A	 3,000 DEM   1.69 DEM  3,200 DEM</p>
<p> CALL B	 3,100 DEM   1.56 DEM  3,300 DEM</p>
<p> CALL C	 3,200 DEM   1.41 DEM  3,400 DEM</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
